{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-03-11 08:00:00', 'title': 'IBM POSITIONED AS A LEADER IN TWO NEWLY RELEASED GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT REPORTS', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., MARCH 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT GLOBAL RESEARCH FIRM GARTNER HAS POSITIONED IBM AS A LEADER IN TWO NEWLY PUBLISHED GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT REPORTS: THE 2021 MAGIC QUADRANT FOR CLOUD AI DEVELOPER SERVICES1 AND THE 2021 MAGIC QUADRANT FOR DATA SCIENCE AND MACHINE LEARNING PLATFORMS2.'}